%% Data synchronization sequence (PLANNED design, docs/offline-edition/05)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant DB as Site MongoDB
  participant AG as Sync agent
  participant OB as SyncOutbox/SyncState
  participant CL as Cloud /api/sync/v1
  participant MR as Cloud mirror
  DB-->>AG: change stream event
  AG->>OB: outbox row (syncSeq) + resume token
  loop while online
    AG->>CL: push batch (siteId:syncSeq)
    CL->>MR: upsert if version < incoming
    CL-->>AG: ok | duplicate | conflict | rejected
    AG->>OB: advance watermark
  end
  CL-->>AG: inbox items (remote orders, PhonePe relay, revocations)
  AG->>DB: re-execute via services (site pricing), exactly once
